{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13220970","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13220970","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:2:1322097001:1":{"text":"戴蒙他怎么了……他以前一直很听话的，他……他从来都不会这样反驳我……","source_cn":"戴蒙他怎么了……他以前一直很听话的，他……他从来都不会...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x089224EC1EF34B57","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322097002:1":{"text":"我是为了他……以前他总是被同龄人欺负，那些孩子根本没有把他当成真正的朋友……","source_cn":"我是为了他……以前他总是被同龄人欺负，那些孩子根本没有...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1D8D7795457C7522","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322097003:1":{"text":"雪米拉女士，你说的这些是你们生前之事，已经过去了。现在，你们是以亡灵的身份在生活——和人类完全不同的生活。","source_cn":"雪米拉女士，你说的这些是你们生前之事，已经过去了。现在...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8D9C22C40FB2E1F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1322097004:1":{"text":"不，戴蒙并不像你所想象的那样虚弱，相反，他拥有无与伦比的力量！","source_cn":"不，戴蒙并不像你所想象的那样虚弱，相反，他拥有无与伦比...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA83DB31F55B8A14B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322097005:1":{"text":"请相信我。我之前亲眼所见——","source_cn":"请相信我。我之前亲眼所见——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3EF4DB895EF36E96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:雪米拉":{"text":"雪米拉","source":"雪米拉","status":"source"},"speaker:柳博米尔":{"text":"柳博米尔","source":"柳博米尔","status":"source"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":6,"localized_text_count":5,"speaker_count":2}}